  "description": "Installation of an air conditioning unit at rear (reconsult due to repositioning the unit)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of its bulk, scale and position, would comprise an incongruous and obtrusive addition that would fail to preserve the character and appearance of the original building, the wider terrace and the setting of the Graham Road and Mapledene Conservation Area. As such, the proposal is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach), D4 (Delivering good design) and HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extension and Alterations SPD (2026), the National Planning Policy Framework and the Graham Road and Mapledene Area Appraisal (1997)."
